"""Generate the sentence parity fixture from quebra_frases.

Writes sentence_parity.json: each row is a text and the sentences that
quebra_frases `sentence_tokenize` gives for it. test/frontend.test.ts checks
the JS `sentenceTokenize` against every row. UPSTREAM holds every text that
the sentence tests of quebra_frases (test/test_tokenization.py, branch
release-0.3.8a6) pass to `sentence_tokenize`. RULES holds texts for each rule
of the split, with the edge cases a JS port can get wrong: Python and the
`regex` module do not agree with JavaScript on whitespace, and JavaScript
counts a character outside the BMP as two.

Regenerate the fixture with quebra-frases from PyPI:

    uv venv .venv-fixtures
    uv pip install -p .venv-fixtures/bin/python --prerelease=allow quebra-frases==0.3.8a6
    .venv-fixtures/bin/python test/fixtures/gen_sentence_parity.py
"""
